{"id": "msg_bd04f1b965f1441aaa1cb05a5e71cd0f", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_a1f7a22ba3f04b6c9598911d", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"| ID | Name | Group Path | Type | Host | Port | Database | Note |\\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\\n| e04d6343-852e-40cb-b822-b205b071f6a6 | 老禅道 |  | mysql | mysql.zhi.com | 3306 | zentao |  |\\n| d4e4e9b7-06e4-4487-b8bf-4c4270255c61 | 房地产监测V3 |  | dameng | dameng.v2.fangchanzonghe.shiqu.suzhou.dev.zhi.com | 5236 |  |  |\\n| 4027e274-2f63-49e6-8a8d-5f25eb1e6c5e | 新禅道 |  | mysql | 192.168.1.87 | 13306 | zentao |  |\\n| 70d787c5-043c-41eb-9721-e4538276e305 | 苏住房测试 |  | dameng | dameng.v2.suzhufang.shiqu.suzhou.test.zhi.com | 5236 |  |  |\\n| cd09bd70-ae23-44a9-8aaa-540f5e1c3318 | 门户Dameng-dev |  | dameng | 192.168.1.101 | 15236 | ZHISHU_PORTAL |  |\\n| b88a0070-0b16-4e5a-bf22-82392b8e7e70 | 门户Dameng-dev2 |  | dameng | dameng.v2.fangchanzonghe.shiqu.suzhou.dev.zhi.com | 5236 | ZHISHU_PORTAL |  |\\n| b08963ef-5200-44d7-bb17-b251dcd9d525 | 榆林G-物管后端(Dameng) |  | dameng | dameng.v2.wuguan.all.yulin.test.zhi.com | 5236 | COMMON_FRAMEWORK |  |\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_bd04f1b965f1441aaa1cb05a5e71cd0f", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 987, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:55:02.938Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
{"id": "msg_f9c320aa22094e0198e55a470fe571ba", "role": "user", "parts": [{"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_b73401c462f64e419beeabb2", "tool_name": "mcp__openviking__search", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "completed", "tool_output": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/禅道缺陷\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.83\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# Entities Overview\\n**Category:** 禅道缺陷\\n\\n- [zentao_bug_6281](./zentao_bug_6281.md)\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/禅道缺陷/zentao_bug_6281.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.82\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 禅道 Bug 6281\\n  ## 根因\\n  ## 修复\\n  ## 状态\\n\\n禅道项目管理模块中楼幢变更维护页面的滚动条缺陷，奇安信旧内核下仅控制基本信息区域。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/软件缺陷\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.82\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# Entities Overview\\n**Category:** 软件缺陷\\n\\n- [禅道6281](./禅道6281.md)\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/zentao_dbx_update.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.80\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 禅道 Bug 状态回写（DBX 直写）\\n  ## 适用场景\\n  ## 更新 zt_bug 字段\\n  ## 插入 zt_action 操作历史\\n\\n当禅道 API 工具不可用时，通过 DBX 直连数据库事务化更新 bug 状态的可复用工作流。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/软件缺陷/禅道6281.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.80\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 禅道6281\\n  ## 页面定位\\n  ## 根因\\n  ## 处置结论\\n\\n项目管理模块楼幢变更维护页面在奇安信可信浏览器中滚动条仅控制基本信息、底部单元/房屋表格被裁的缺陷单。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/禅道回写dbx绕行.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.79\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 禅道回写DBX绕行\\n  ## 适用场景\\n  ## 操作步骤\\n  ## 涉及文件与验证\\n\\n禅道 API 类工具被高风险策略拦截时，改用 dbx 直连 SQL 更新任务表并落 zt_action 动态表完成回写。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/permit_whitescreen_fix.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.76\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# 预售许可申请维护白屏与页签丢失修复\\n  ## 问题根因\\n  ## 修复方案\\n  ## 可复用判断\\n  ## 验证与归属\\n\\n苏州市房地产监测V3 中预售许可申请页点「维护」偶发整页白屏、页签栏从10个剩1个、图标显示方框的根因与修法（禅道 bug 6285）。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/entities/技术模式/has_fallback_fix.md\\\" type=\\\"entities\\\" score=\\\"0.76\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\n# zhi2-web-admin :has() 兜底方案\\n  ## 背景\\n  ## 兜底方案\\n  ## 项目归属\\n  ## 验证方式\\n\\nzhi2-web-admin 的 index.scss 与 main.js 使用 :has() 选择器，需为不支持的浏览器（如奇安信可信浏览器 Chromium<105）提供兜底。对应禅道 bug 6279。\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/events/2026/11/02/cursor封批重传导致整轮失败.md\\\" type=\\\"events\\\" score=\\\"0.76\\\" detail=\\\"overview\\\">\\ncursor 通道报 native call arrived after its batch was sealed 的根因与修复\\n</memory>\\n<memory uri=\\\"viking://user/default/memories/preferences/user/列表固定状态字段修复流程.md\\\" type=\\\"preferences\\\" score=\\\"0.75\\\" detail=\\\"uri\\\" />\"}]", "tool_output_group_id": "msg_f9c320aa22094e0198e55a470fe571ba", "tool_output_group_original_chars": 2397, "tool_output_group_budget_chars": 100000}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:55:03.323Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
{"id": "msg_9bf47ca9d852420ab287992be7356c5d", "role": "assistant", "parts": [{"type": "text", "text": "无 6315 相关历史记忆。本机只有主工作区（develop/v3.0.0），子模块 zhi2-web-admin 干净，落地位置默认主工作区。现在查 bug 详情与备注："}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_d9cf852909eb4c7793db4fe6", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"arguments": {"connection_id": "4027e274-2f63-49e6-8a8d-5f25eb1e6c5e", "sql": "SELECT id,title,status,severity,openedBy,openedDate,assignedTo,product,project,execution,openedBuild,resolution,resolvedBuild,keywords FROM zt_bug WHERE id=6315"}, "server": "dbx", "tool": "dbx_execute_query"}}, {"type": "tool", "tool_id": "call_9ac5938903a14fa1b186fff7", "tool_name": "mcp_gateway", "tool_uri": "", "skill_uri": "", "tool_status": "running", "tool_input": {"arguments": {"connection_id": "4027e274-2f63-49e6-8a8d-5f25eb1e6c5e", "sql": "SELECT id, actor, action, date, LEFT(comment,1000) cmt FROM zt_action WHERE objectType='bug' AND objectID=6315 ORDER BY id"}, "server": "dbx", "tool": "dbx_execute_query"}}], "created_at": "2026-11-06T08:55:16.528Z", "peer_id": "gitlab.zhi.com-zhi-suzhou-shiqu-fangdichan-fe-zhi3-web-admin-h5-g-unlimited"}
